egl: an fbdev platform (not for upstream)

EGL on a framebuffer device, for systems whose display has no KMS driver
and whose GPU is under the DDK's services driver (pvrsrvkm), which has no
dma-buf sharing: the window is the framebuffer, and the driver renders
into it directly. -Dplatforms=fbdev.

